cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this formalization, please cite it as below.
title: 'Critical long-range conductance: a Lean 4 formalization'
abstract: A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of quantitative homogenization and the quenched invariance
  principle for the critical long-range random conductance model, with 23 theorem exports and three
  complete definition exports. The main theorem produces the unique H10 weak solution and its continuous
  representative. Results retain explicit cited-input hypotheses; the 16 cited propositions are
  assumptions, not proofs of the outside papers.
type: software
